; WHAT THE ASH TAKES ON THE WAY UP (group ash_takes): each goes white, then blank, once she is
; `taken_at` along the slope, over `taken_over` seconds (level_5.gd). None is solid: a thing going
; white must never be something she is standing on. The bridge she would have crossed is gone
; long before she can reach it (2.0 s, from 1300 px off); the stone steps that led up the wall
; are gone before she is at it; a palm goes pale, then white, as she passes.
[node name="AshTakes" type="Node2D" parent="GameplayPlane"]
z_index = -4

